datatype=rdflib.term.URIRef('http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer')), rdflib.term.Literal('http://university.org/ontology/Student13, \r\nhttp://university.org/ontology/Student14, http://university.org/ontology/Student15, http://university.org/ontology/Student16, \r\nhttp://university.org/ontology/Student17, http://university.org/ontology/Student24'))\r\n\r\n"]
